OL,4,CFrench police officers sentenced for   
OL,5,Cbeating of music producer Michel Zecler
OL,6,GThree French police officers have been 
OL,7,Gconvicted of beating up a black music  
OL,8,Gproducer six years ago in Paris in     
OL,9,Gwhat the court upheld as an aggravated 
OL,10,Gcircumstance of racism.                
OL,12,FThe three were also found guilty of    
OL,13,Fsigning a falsified police report      
OL,14,Fstating that the producer - Michel     
OL,15,FZecler, 47 - had violently resisted    
OL,16,Ftheir attempt to arrest him.           
